# Hardhat Contracts Project - Environment Configuration
# WARNING: NEVER commit the real .env file or share private keys.

# 1. Sepolia JSON-RPC Endpoint URL (Required for contract deployment to Sepolia)
# Obtain an endpoint from Alchemy (https://www.alchemy.com), Infura (https://www.infura.io), or a public RPC provider.
# Example: https://eth-sepolia.g.alchemy.com/v2/your-api-key
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=

# 2. Deployer Wallet Private Key (Required for signing deployment transactions)
# Export from a dedicated test wallet in MetaMask (Account Details -> Show Private Key).
# WARNING: Use ONLY a dedicated test wallet with Sepolia test ETH. Never use a mainnet account or an account holding real funds.
PRIVATE_KEY=